## Limitations & Future Work

### Current Limitations

1. ⚠️ No guard expressions in pattern matching
   - Switch patterns cannot include conditions
   - Example: `pattern if condition => ...` not supported

2. ⚠️ Limited pattern exhaustiveness checking
   - Wildcard patterns not validated
   - Union type variants not verified

3. ⚠️ Error type declaration generation incomplete
   - Basic mapping to `int` codes only
   - Named error types not fully supported

4. ⚠️ No defer optimization
   - No elimination of redundant defers
   - No inlining of trivial cleanup code

5. ⚠️ Scope tracking relies on AIR metadata
   - Custom scope ID system required
   - May need enhancement for complex nesting

### Planned Enhancements

1. 🔮 Guard expressions (`pattern if condition => ...`)
   - Full condition evaluation
   - Variable binding in guards

2. 🔮 Pattern exhaustiveness verification
   - Compile-time union type checking
   - Incomplete pattern detection

3. 🔮 Named error types
   - Enum generation with meaningful names
   - Error set definitions

4. 🔮 Defer optimization
   - Dead code elimination
   - Constant folding for cleanup sequences

5. 🔮 Scope tracking enhancement
   - Automatic scope ID generation
   - Implicit nesting support

